OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud clearing to leave a
OL,6,Fsunny day for most. However, some
OL,7,Fcloud returning across the far west
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, with perhaps an
OL,9,Fisolated shower possible. Feeling hot
OL,10,Fin the sunshine, with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally dry, with clear
OL,13,Fspells. A few showers remain possible,
OL,14,Fthough mostly light in nature as they
OL,15,Fpass. Remaining warm in urban areas,
OL,16,Fwith a light northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
